WEBVTT

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:15.310
No, it's Super-Man!

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.130
Super-Man!

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:20.590
The fake Super-Man!

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:58.620
Fast as lightning, more powerful than a tidal wave, stronger than a hurricane, this fantastic alien from the planet Krypton, the Iron Man, Superman!

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:10.930
With the help of an incredible physical strength, Superman fights incessantly for truth and justice, disguised as a timid newspaper reporter. Clark Kent.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.700
John Ross.

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:55.360
It was time to show up.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.640
Hurry up and deliver everything.

00:01:57.960 --> 00:01:59.940
Yes, boss. It's all here.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:10.860
This job is very good, boss. And this superman outfit works as a charm.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:21.600
Wow, boss! It was just a grade of five.

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:24.470
Next time you will lose five fingers.

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:29.880
Superman commits a...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:30.800
...a series of crimes...

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:35.540
...and opens the fence against the superman.

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:41.580
Friend becomes enemy. But this is ridiculous.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:46.180
It can't be the superman. What do you think of this, Clark?

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:49.420
Hey, you two, the editor wants you to cover the opera soon.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:53.560
And don't forget, formal costume.

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:57.260
Great! I'll be able to wear my long dress.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:00.560
Thank you.

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:58.380
Are you really a man?

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:11.260
My father-in-law is looking for the mole.

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:51.480
Oh, it's not me, I swear! It's not me, it's the boss!

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:53.280
He forced me to do this!

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:55.920
Hey, calm down, please, Mr. Superman, give me a chance!

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:58.180
I'll regenerate, I swear I'll find everything!

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.550
Oh no, I burned myself!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.000
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:05:07.452 --> 00:05:09.452
I knew it was a bad story.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:33.480
So, did you like the opera?

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:39.280
What's the matter, idiot? Did you lose your tongue?

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:44.440
Don't stand there like a mummy, give me the jewels!

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:48.560
Are you trying to push me back?

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:53.420
Oh, my God!

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:58.510
Boss, he's a superman!

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:04.980
Well, I didn't expect to find you here, huh?

00:07:05.052 --> 00:07:05.712
Bless them.

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:57.840
What an amazing subject!

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:02.350
What's the problem, shiny eyes? Does the opera make you sad?

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.350
I was dreaming that it was the superman.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.490
Great superman you would be.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:12.000
Well, I can dream, can't I?
